aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Until the orb is published, copy the inline jobs from this repository’s &lt;a href="https://github.com/CircleCI-Labs/smarter-workflows/blob/main/.circleci/config.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;.circleci/config.yml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (they build the planner from source).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="catalog"&gt;Catalog&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="catalog"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#catalog" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move jobs, workflows, orbs and executors to &lt;code&gt;.circleci/continue.yml&lt;/code&gt;. That file is the catalog; nothing Smarter-specific is required inside it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn on setup workflows under &lt;strong&gt;Project Settings → Advanced&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze treats mapped inputs as directory prefixes (&lt;code&gt;.&lt;/code&gt; is the whole repo). Jobs with opaque steps always run until &lt;code&gt;learn&lt;/code&gt; improves the map.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="artifacts-and-branch-protection"&gt;Artifacts and branch protection&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="artifacts-and-branch-protection"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#artifacts-and-branch-protection" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every &lt;code&gt;plan&lt;/code&gt; run stores &lt;code&gt;smarter-plan/plan.md&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;plan.json&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;analyze-report.md&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every &lt;code&gt;learn&lt;/code&gt; run stores &lt;code&gt;smarter-learn/learn.md&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;learn.json&lt;/code&gt;, and updates the learned layer cache (&lt;code&gt;learned-key-prefix&lt;/code&gt;, default &lt;code&gt;smarter-learned-v1&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Require the continued workflow’s GitHub check, or per-job &lt;code&gt;smarter-gate&lt;/code&gt; if you use job checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="pipeline-parameters"&gt;Pipeline parameters&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="pipeline-parameters"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#pipeline-parameters" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If &lt;code&gt;continue.yml&lt;/code&gt; uses workflow &lt;code&gt;when&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;unless&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;pipeline.parameters.*&lt;/code&gt;, set the &lt;code&gt;parameters&lt;/code&gt; job parameter to a JSON file of values. The planner writes &lt;code&gt;parameters.json&lt;/code&gt; under the plan report for &lt;code&gt;continue&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="optional-guardrails"&gt;Optional guardrails&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="optional-guardrails"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#optional-guardrails" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Copy &lt;a href="https://github.com/CircleCI-Labs/smarter-workflows/tree/main/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;policies/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, edit settings at the top of &lt;code&gt;guardrails.rego&lt;/code&gt;, and set &lt;code&gt;policy-bundle: policies&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;plan&lt;/code&gt;. Run &lt;code&gt;circleci policy test policies&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="several-pipelines-in-one-project"&gt;Several pipelines in one project&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="several-pipelines-in-one-project"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#several-pipelines-in-one-project" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Share one project cache but give each setup config its own &lt;code&gt;learned-key-prefix&lt;/code&gt;. No prefix may be a prefix of another (use &lt;code&gt;smarter-demo-learned-v1&lt;/code&gt; beside &lt;code&gt;smarter-learned-v1&lt;/code&gt;, not &lt;code&gt;smarter-learned-v1-demo&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Demo monorepo</title><link>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/get-started/demo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/get-started/demo/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;A small polyglot monorepo that runs on Smarter Workflows. Every job does real but fast work, so you can watch the planner pick jobs from a change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;services/api Go, with a handler and a test
services/web Node, tested with node:test
services/worker Python, tested with unittest
libs/proto schema.json, read by the api and the web tests
docs/ Markdown, checked for titles and links
infra/ Terraform files, checked for their shape
scripts/ what the lint, docs, infra, security and e2e jobs run&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
